"empfohlen, :class:`Connection.row_factory` zu setzen, damit alle aus der "
"Verbindung erzeugten Cursor dieselbe Row-Factory verwenden."

#: ../../library/sqlite3.rst:2266
msgid ""
":class:`!Row` provides indexed and case-insensitive named access to columns, "
"with minimal memory overhead and performance impact over a :class:`!tuple`. "
